&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;useActionState&lt;/code&gt; is another React 19 hook. It handles form submission state, pending &lt;br&gt;
state, and server errors in one call. No &lt;code&gt;useState&lt;/code&gt; for loading. No &lt;code&gt;try/catch&lt;/code&gt; in &lt;br&gt;
the component.&lt;/p&gt;




